  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ID-TF PNPM GREEN Awareness Raising Project in Sumatera</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to implement awareness raising and capacity building activities as part of the Facilitation Support component of PNPM Green in Sumatra. The target locations are Agam and Padang Pariaman Districts of West Sumatra Province, and Lebong District of Bengkulu Province.</narrative>
